{"ID":"20240118145011-0ztmo9t","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145011-0ztmo9t","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145011-0ztmo9t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145011-c3j4m1c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122162619-zu3nw3u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:600,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122162600-35z6bh8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:355,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:449\u0026#125;","title":"337白颈蚯蚓338翳螉","type":"doc","updated":"20240204150012"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145011-c3j4m1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145011-c3j4m1c","updated":"20240122162532"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"白颈蚯蚓"}]},{"ID":"20240122162533-vwgvf5g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162533-vwgvf5g","updated":"20240122162540"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味咸，寒，无毒。治蛇瘕，去三虫，伏尸，鬼疰，虫毒，杀长虫。仍自化作水。生平土。今名地龙。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162543-qfp8hql","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162543-qfp8hql"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】田中或韭田中及地下，处处有之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162544-ydx5avu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162544-ydx5avu"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味甘酸，性寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162546-9nmtbo2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162546-9nmtbo2"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】蚯蚓主解毒，傅疮，小便不通，赤白痢疾。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162547-i95ncn3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162547-i95ncn3"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【藏器】主赤白久热痢，取一升炒烟尽，沃汁半升滤净饮之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162549-qa8vlhp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162549-qa8vlhp"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【日华】小儿阴囊忽虚热肿痛，以生甘草汁入轻粉末调涂之，以盐研傅疮去热毒，及蛇犬伤。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162551-0tsdr3m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162551-0tsdr3m"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【苏敬】傅狂犬伤，出犬毛神效。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162553-w0gkxis","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162553-w0gkxis"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通一钱至三钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162553-qqlbero","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162553-qqlbero"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】内服宜煎汁澄清，不必用渣。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162554-x9myv9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162554-x9myv9o"}},{"ID":"20240122162554-eayw0jp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162554-eayw0jp"}},{"ID":"20240122162554-p4wmfkh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162554-p4wmfkh","updated":"20240204145637"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"337，白颈蚯蚓，蚯蚓要找脖子是白色的，俗名我们叫地龙。蚯蚓爱在地下钻嘛，我们叫地龙。味咸，诸位看，性味甘酸，那个性味里面的时候，味甘酸性寒无毒，本经说味咸寒无毒，有一点差异。真的实际上它是有咸味。"}]},{"ID":"20240122162600-35z6bh8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162600-35z6bh8","updated":"20240204150012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蚯蚓呢主解毒，赤白痢啊，我们常常在用蚯蚓的时候，用在攻坚，比如说妇人有干血痨，里面有淤血的时候，我们会用地龙，因为地龙是无孔不入。还有呢，在脑积水的时候，也会用到地龙，因为这个水停在脑部里面，如果泥土挡到，水浮在上面就下不来，所以我们用地龙下去，脑部肿瘤，脑瘤的时候我们会使用到地龙，因为地龙的能够疏通开来，然后生半夏，把水导下来。所以说这个地龙本身在泥土里面到处钻啊挖啊，翻土一样，这个自己在那边翻土，那这个只要有地龙的土都会比较肥沃，同样的利于排水，这个泥土有地龙在里面，土的排水的效果也会很好。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"【日华】：小儿阴囊忽然肿痛啊，这个时候我们用这个，生的甘草汁加些轻粉沫还有配合些地龙，这个来调他。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用剂量上面，地龙非常的凶，这个吃下去，吃多人身体会虚，所以说，一般来说像我这种体格，你用两钱就可以了。那中药有饭前还是饭后服，如果我们要病人，这个药能够攻到脑部去，大部分都是饭后吃，要攻到往下焦攻到小肠大肠攻到膝盖攻到脚部的时候，都是饭前吃，大部分都是这样子。那发表的药也是在饭前吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240122162605-xxx59g4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162605-xxx59g4"}},{"ID":"20240122162606-qp17n30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162606-qp17n30"}},{"ID":"20240122162607-jc7aq4r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162607-jc7aq4r","updated":"20240122162610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"翳螉"}]},{"ID":"20240122162611-c4chdq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162611-c4chdq5","updated":"20240122162615"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，平，无毒。治久聋，咳逆，毒气，出刺，出汗。生川谷或人屋间。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122162616-y2msmjj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162616-y2msmjj"}},{"ID":"20240122162619-zu3nw3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122162619-zu3nw3u","updated":"20240122162624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个338，这个药我们用的也不多，根本现在没有人会用它。"}]}]}